        <xhtml:p class="MsoNormal">
          <xhtml:span style="font-size: 18.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; color: black; background: white;">Amounts charged by Kinder Morgan, Inc., through shared services are allocated using the modified Massachusetts Formula.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
